<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-10-24T16:46:07.227Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 16:46:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;El Salvador special forces have entered Haiti to rescue four kidnapped aviation technicians and four Salvadoran soldiers after a gang ambush. Haitian gangs carried out the ambush that captured the Salvadoran personnel, prompting Bukele to warn of a harsh response to further attacks. Displacement continues as civilians flee armed violence in the communes of Petite Rivière de l'Artibonite and Arcahaie. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQRF9KQW1CR1hkUXlEZTFrZFZrUGh4ZjdLTWxlR3p0cElTRnk4WGpzS2JpV2FqX2ktRWJrMmxWT1o1U2swWlRLXy0tRDQ5OFZ0Y2wxUk91eV9RMGVvX3FRU2JUWDVUczk0bjNnek1aQnRJbTNaQnRmZ2ZqdlljRTNyN3hSVmNtZkVlU0lVWGFHNldZSTVST1RlWkFrcUVHclEzay1TYW05R3ExbGQtMkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxNOHVwako5bEZBaFBQNmhNQ04zSGxpdHQ5Si1QSkJKWVhUakpKSlkwb01xalM4RUVLMklsU2NyQUNueHJQa3lKd2hfbS1WMXh6TEcxNWkxbXp3Vlo2enFlNUxPQVkwNU1MMzF6dmVfMW8tTjNwOHNIVldsdWtPbDVRTDBlcHRjSVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPaUVfcHo5QnJBR1pkQ0swOEcxQnZYQW9uLXVxWURpUkUxdGhwOXhsSXNWd0g2NGdzd2FmQVY2Wk5YcjZtSS1TWXVvNEJ4N2NmMGN4M21RS2E1UlJ3NFBCMlAzcVJxWGxOdDcyRXE3MHluMzJ5ZHhGblNaV3RTSVVLYUpkb2xRdHZJUFVmNW1mQlQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQQ202dHdUU3ViV0c5Um5fdEZrcHVuUjlfOTZZdk1oeHluT3JpbHNZWVJzcW43WDF6N01wSGRNOGlDSDc2YmU4WEJkb3J3STloOW9VdmVtRFFnSUlHRHp1YzA0cTlObXpZLXFQY2NrWkktejV1Qm9femlEZUpfVFVfMnZBODBPQXREYjg2WUVwSW02eWltM2hhdW1JTHRMVEtYVTZpVjFnZ1loNFNHdEtvcEw0dERqNHdyV3FTdQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;h